  "notes": "advanced-troubleshooting's sharedSections has includeSharedPrerequisites=false and includeSharedTroubleshootingFooter=false (its real MSC 1 values) \u2014 both sections are absent from the output entirely, not just empty. The menu-path section is still present despite an empty menuPath array, because menuPathSection's guard is `hasMenuPath || hasAlternates`, and alternateMenuNames is non-empty \u2014 a section can appear from alternates alone with a genuinely empty `path` list inside it. A note's title being nil (troubleshooting-note-2) round-trips as JSON null."
